                0.902,
                0.821,
                0.932
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Fig. 4.8: Direction of average acceleration when magnitude of velocity is (a) increasing, and (b) decreasing"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
